      "description": "Careers Careers // 860-701-5000 admissions@mitchell.edu Facebook Instagram LinkedIn Youtube Facebook Instagram LinkedIn Youtube Alumni Giving Parents Faculty & Staff Students Why Mitchell Teaching Adaptability Playing to Your Strengths Celebrating Diverse Thinkers At A Glance Thames at Mitchell College The SAILS Program A Message from President Espy Academics Academic Calendars Academic Calendar 2026/27 Academic Calendar 2025-26 Professional Studies Calendar 2026-2027 Professional Studies Calendar 2025-2026 Undergraduate Programs Applied Exercise Science Business Management Criminal Justice Digital Communication Early Childhood Education First-Year Experience General Education Health Sciences Honors Program Individualized Studies Marine and Environmental Science Minors Nursing Professional Studies – Business Professional Studies – Health and Human Services Psychology Sport Management Graduate Program Academic & Social Support Accessibility Services Advising The Bentsen Learning Center The SAILS Program Thames at Mitchell College Tutoring Center Career: Integrative Career Development Dual Enrollment College Catalog Intersession Library Meet Our Faculty Mitchell Ability Model Registrar Summer Internships Summer Courses Jumpstart Program Thames at Mitchell College Student Life Resources Life at Mitchell Performing Arts Health & Wellness Campus Safety Title IX and Non-Discrimination Policy Activities Bookstore Gear Store Dining Services Athletics Athletics Continuing Education Mitchell Hub: Digital Innovation & Educational Excellence STAIRs News & Stories News & Stories Public Spaces Children’s Learning Center Event & Meeting Space Rentals Michael’s Dairy Mitchell Beach The Red Barn Pop-up Gear Shop Admissions Visits & Events Visits & Events Campus Map & Directions Request Information Accepted Students Adult Learners Apply to Mitchell Apply to Thames Cost & Financial Aid Transfer Students School Counselors Veterans Meet the Team Select Page Employment Opportunities Why Choose Employment at Mitchell? Our employees are one of our greatest resources and we take pride in being able to offer a competitive wage, along with comprehensive and affordable benefits—all the standard stuff everyone expects, plus all of this: Employee Assistance Program for those everyday life issues Free Life Insurance Low cost short and long term disability coverage Pet Insurance for your furrier family members Generous retirement benefits through TIAA Free on-site gym facilities Free tuition for spouses and dependents (ask HR for more details) Generous time off allowances Mitchell College is an Equal Opportunity Employer and does not discriminate in employment on the basis of race, color, religion, sex, national origin, ancestry, political affiliation, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, marital status, disability and genetic information, age, membership in an employee organization or other non-merit factors. Current Open Positions Faculty and Staff Positions > Student Employment > Mitchell College 437 Pequot Avenue New London, CT 06320 860-701-5000 admissions@mitchell.edu APPLY NOW! Campus Safety Careers Contact Us Privacy Policy Terms & Conditions Title IX & Non-Discrimination Web Accessibility Close the accessibility toolbar Accessibility visibility_off Disable flashes title Mark headings settings Background Color zoom_out Zoom out zoom_in Zoom in remove_circle_outline Decrease font add_circle_outline Increase font spellcheck Readable font brightness_high Bright contrast brightness_low Dark contrast format_underlined Underline links font_download Mark links Reset all options cached Manage Cookie Consent To provide the best experiences, we use technologies like cookies to store and/or access device information. Consenting to these technologies will allow us to process data such as browsing behavior or unique IDs on this site. Not consenting or withdrawing consent, may adversely affect certain features and functions. Fun